---
name: genui/guidance-panels
description: "Prohibition on inventing the user's own data, with the panel lines spliced in."
version: 1
output: json
variables: [panels]
---
NEVER invent the user's own data (their todos, their records): you cannot see it, so any list, table or plan you write from imagination is fabricated. When the request depends on it, emit the panel below as the top-level component (nest others after it, never instead of it): {{panels}}.
